{"id":"o2q87zj6fmch2ppr9d83bbu32","title":"Nvidia 股票分红策略 ETF 仍被持有建议","originalTitle":"NVDY: Weekly Checks May Rise Into A Falling NAV","summary":"Nvidia 股票分红策略 ETF (NVDY) 由于持续的 NAV 腐蚀和下降的分红，维持持有建议。尽管 NVDY 预估年分红率为 30%，但股价已下跌 35.8%，且其合成期权策略的结构性缺陷使得 NAV 深度下跌难以恢复。短期内波动可能暂时提升分红，但长期趋势显示收入下降，NVDY 不适合稳定收入投资者。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"Seeking Alpha"},"links":{"original":"https://seekingalpha.com/article/4965857-nvdy-weekly-checks-may-rise-into-a-falling-nav?source=feed_all_articles"},"publishedAt":"2026-11-10T17:21:28.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-11-10T17:39:19.978Z","timelineAt":"2026-11-10T17:39:19.978Z","category":"stock-us","tags":["研究报告","半导体","NVIDIA"],"score":42,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"92caa6d1-096e-4989-a6c6-3e1e7c3b8e47","title":"NVIDIA股票分红策略ETF维持持有评级：高分红被股价下跌及策略缺陷抵消"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"92caa6d1-096e-4989-a6c6-3e1e7c3b8e47","title":"NVIDIA股票分红策略ETF维持持有评级：高分红被股价下跌及策略缺陷抵消"}],"topics":[{"slug":"nvidia","name":"NVIDIA / 英伟达"},{"slug":"semiconductor","name":"半导体"},{"slug":"research","name":"研究报告"},{"slug":"opinions","name":"观点"},{"slug":"howto","name":"教程与避坑"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fohbYGysdnu0","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}